🌐 Сайт: trustnodelab.github.io

en:
✅ Before the start of studies, scammers with fake housing rentals became active.

📌 How they work:
— place tempting advertisements;
- ask for prepayment in advance;
- often imitate the work of real estate agencies.

❗ Signs of deception:
— low rental price;
— promise of no utility bills;
- requirement for payment in advance.

🔍 Be careful when looking for housing! Check the information and avoid prepayments.

🛡️ TrustNode
📱 Application: RuStore
🌐 Website: trustnodelab.github.io
